      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOMBELLEISTIC (2) got the job done here two back before heading to Wyong last start and ending up 3.5L off the winner. Back to this track and out to 1900m both look big ticks, with Brodie Loy hopping on board. He looks to get every chance from the inside and can land the knockout blow. SUNBURNT COUNTRY (4) missed behind BOMBELLEISTIC two back when an odds-on pop before going to Kembla last time and finishing 3L off the winner. Back to this level is a big tick and it wouldn't surprise to see him return to winning ways. REMADOSI (3) didn't have much luck at a crucial stage last start when flashing late to miss by 0.87L. Out to this trip suits her better now and she may be able to be a touch closer this time. Fitter again now and can return to winning ways. DEVINE OUTCAST (5) missed by 1L at Bathurst last time but has won 2/4 when third-up previously. Keep safe. FLASHY ICON (6) has claims off a strong run here last time out.",
